{
	"name": "Toxic Regeneration",
	"type": "feat",
	"system": {
		"description": {
			"value": "<p><strong>Bonus Action</strong> - Self and each creature within 5 ft.</p><p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]] can use this only while it has fewer than its full Hit Points. Its flesh knits itself together, spewing volatile organic compounds.</p><p><strong>[[/save constitution]]{Constitution Save}</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> [[/damage]] damage. The [[lookup @name lowercase]] is resistant to this damage.</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No effect.</p></li></ul><p>Then, if this doesn't reduce the [[lookup @name lowercase]] to 0 Hit Points, it regains 5 Hit Points.</p><p><em>If the [[lookup @name lowercase]] isn't in danger and is at 15 Hit Points or more, assume it can regain all its Hit Points over 10 minutes without any danger.</em></p>",
